      "promptText": "Use case: stylized-concept.\nAsset type: NEW portrait 2D architectural backdrop illustration for a casual mobile collectible showroom. Target composition aspect 551:984 (roughly9:16), full bleed portrait.\nPrimary request: Draw only the EMPTY showroom cabinet architecture, with a cream stone arched upper crown, warm orange blank inset under the arch, an empty open upper display alcove, and THREE empty glass-front rectangular display cases stacked vertically beneath it. All are empty so separate collectible illustrations can later be placed in them. Newly drawn art, never a screenshot or traced game screen.\nStyle: polished softly shaded 3D-cartoon game environment, rounded cream-white mouldings, warm peach wall, gentle taupe interiors, very pale blue-grey case frames, subtle glass reflections, cheerful soft warm light. Front-on symmetrical cabinet; perspective only a small depth inside the open alcove and shelves. Crisp and uncluttered.\nComposition: camera front view. A broad cream-white architectural arched crown at top from about y1% to20%, cropped gently at left/right edges as fullbleed architecture. The blank warm orange inset inside the upper arch has NO symbols or lettering. Below is a wide empty open alcove from about21% to35%, with taupe back wall, cream side pillars and a cream display shelf at its base. Below this open alcove, THREE separate wide empty glass display cabinets are vertically stacked at about38-53%,55-70%,72-86% of image height, extending roughly7-93% of image width. Each cabinet has a quiet taupe back wall, thin pale blue-grey rectangular frame, small pale hinge/handle details on both sides, a glass front with just two faint diagonal light reflections, and an empty pale shelf base. The centers of all three cases must be clearly empty and mostly untextured for later separate assets. Lower14% is plain warm peach/cream wall or floor with no interface strip or buttons.\nMaterials: cream plaster/stone crown and side trim; satin orange arch interior; clear very lightly reflective glass; pale metal frames; soft muted rose/taupe case interiors.\nText: NONE.\nHard constraints: architectural background artwork ONLY. NO products, collectibles, shields, pedestal objects, cash, coins, dice, cards, gift boxes, hats, figures or characters inside or outside cases. NO UI, no screen capture, no title including SHIELDS, no letters, no numbers, no count pill, no badge, no crest, no emblem, no logos, no info icon, no selection check, no circular tab buttons, no bottom navigation, no footer bar, no X/close button, no prices, no timers, no labels, no notification dots. No added outer UI cast shadow. Exactly THREE lower empty glass cabinets and ONE empty upper open alcove, not four glass cabinets. Full rectangular opaque image; do not add a screen/device border. This is one architectural scene only, not a completed UI."
