      "promptText": "Use case: stylized-concept.\nAsset type: six NEW separate collectible/product illustrations for a casual mobile board-game showroom. Genuine transparent background master sheet.\nPrimary request: Draw exactly six distinct polished soft3D-cartoon game object illustrations. Bright saturated gold/orange/green with ivory dice and warm tan hat. Rounded bevelled forms, gentle internal shading, crisp small-scale silhouettes. Newly drawn artwork, no screenshot pixels, no text or logos.\nComposition: landscape1536x1024, exactly THREE columns and TWO rows of equal512x512 cells. Each object group stays entirely inside its own cell and is centered, reading order left-to-right top-to-bottom exactly as specified. At least60px genuine transparent separation between neighboring illustrations and canvas boundaries. Do not connect cells or draw grid lines. Each cluster is a single reusable illustration, but all surrounding cabinet/shelf architecture is absent.\nTOP LEFT: one simple heraldic SHIELD object, bright plain orange smooth inset, thick bevelled golden rim and narrow cream edge, top slightly arched with two small sloping upper corners, pointed bottom. It is a physical orange shield, no symbols, no letters, no face, no selection check, no pedestal.\nTOP CENTER: one EMPTY gold-orange shield display PEDESTAL object, a low wide trapezoid plinth with rich golden-orange slanted bevelled top, thin warm ivory base rim. EMPTY: no shield, no jewel, no coin, no trophy or other object on it. The pedestal is wider than tall, naturally preserve its compact horizontal proportions, no long surrounding canvas.\nTOP RIGHT: one compact first-shelf REWARD BUNDLE illustration: several blocky stacks of green banknotes with pale yellow paper bands on the left, one large upright plain gold coin disc at center, a few smaller gold coins, and three ivory dice with black circular pips on the right. Green notes and a few small gold coins along the front. NO shelf/frame/case or floor.\nBOTTOM LEFT: one compact middle-shelf REWARD BUNDLE illustration: green banknote stacks on the left, ivory dice with black pips near center-left, one small plain upright gold coin near center, and a large warm orange/gold wrapped gift box with a bright red ribbon and bow on the right. NO shelf/frame/case or floor.\nBOTTOM CENTER: one compact bottom-shelf REWARD BUNDLE illustration: green cash stacks and small gold coin piles on the left, one plain upright gold coin near center, and two overlapping vertical ORANGE foil card packs on the right, their fronts blank with just simple bevels and highlights. NO lettering, numerals, logos, faces, pictograms or patterned crests on the packs. NO shelf/frame/case or floor.\nBOTTOM RIGHT: one small collectible TOP HAT object alone, a warm medium-tan rounded top hat with a darker brown band, short rounded crown and broad slightly curled oval brim. Friendly toy-like shading. No head or person, no circle medallion, no pedestal.\nBackground: genuine transparent alpha everywhere beyond each object's exact silhouette, including gaps between dice and cash and all gutters. No solid color, no painted checkerboard, no floor or ground shadow.\nText: NONE.\nHard constraints: object artwork ONLY. Absolutely no cabinet, display case, background shelf, architectural arch, UI frame, button, circular tab backing, badge, selection check, count, timer, price, banner, title, letters, numbers, logo, watermark, or external cast/drop shadow. Do NOT draw a pirate shield or pirate bird; that asset already exists. Exactly six illustrations in the stated order."
